Subject: Select the material registry and original alpha preparation

Upstream-base: f1e9646a7da6950143e77b1daed33a92c931a638

Keep descriptor/scalar widths at 32 bits, reject duplicate native registrations,
and expose explicit registry teardown before allocator shutdown. Extract only
the original texture alpha preparation for this source subset; look up checked
native texture metadata and fail on missing textures. The remaining generic
parameter API and pointer-bearing parameter kinds are not selected.

